{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@E@MLNTextWritingMode@MLNTextWritingModeVertical","title":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","symbolKind":"case","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodevertical"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeVertical"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If a text’s language supports vertical writing mode, symbols with point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement would be laid out vertically."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"]]},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode/MLNTextWritingModeVertical":{"title":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeVertical","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"If a text’s language supports vertical writing mode, symbols with point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement would be laid out vertically."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodevertical","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeVertical","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode":{"type":"topic","title":"MLNTextWritingMode","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingMode","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The property allows control over a symbol’s orientation. Note that the property","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values act as a hint, so that a symbol whose language doesn’t support the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provided orientation will be laid out in its natural orientation. Example:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"English point symbol will be rendered horizontally even if array value contains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single ‘vertical’ enum value. The order of elements in an array define priority"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"order for the placement of an orientation variant.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol"}}}